    .Net BugBash Bugfix Example 59 - FunctionCalling (Added default serialization to Method Function results) (#3854)

    ### Motivation and Context

    Resolves #3829

    ### Description

    An error happened when attepting to convert Method functions to string
    while sending back to the LLM.
    To resolve the issue the value regardless of the type is converted to a
    JsonString and used as response.

    Another bug was found while detecting the StreamingRole where only one
    chunk will have the role, not all.

